solution_steps:
To solve for x, we square both sides of the equation to get rid of the square root:
\begin{align*}
(\sqrt{x+7})^2 &= 9^2 \\
x+7 &= 81 \\
x &= 81-7 \\
x &= \boxed{74}
\end{align*}
The answer is: 74

